---
title: "Flow"
description: "Adds vertical rhythm by spacing every child after the first."
tags: [layout, typography, css]
usage: |
  Add the `flow` class to a container of content in normal flow, such as prose.
  Set `--flow-space` on the container to change all gaps, or on one child to
  change the space above it.
customProperties:
  "--flow-space": "Space above each child after the first."
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<div class="flow">
  <h3>Heading</h3>
  <p>Paragraph one.</p>
  <p>Paragraph two.</p>
  <p style="--flow-space: 2rem">Paragraph with extra space above.</p>
</div>
